680 - Holy Spirit, Hear Us
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 680
Topic: Sentences and Responses - 

Verse 1:
[G]Holy Spirit, [Em]hear [Bm]us;
[C]Help us while [Bm]we [D]sing;
[Bm]Breath [G/B]into [Em]the [C/E]music
[G/D]Of [D]the [G/D]praise [D7]we [G]bring.

Verse 2:
[G]Holy Spirit, [Em]prompt [Bm]us
[C]When we [Am]kneel [Bm]to [D]pray;
[Bm]Nearer [Am]come, [Em]and [C/E]teach us
[G/D]What [D]we [G/D]ought [D7]to [G]say.

Verse 3:
[G]Holy Spirit, [Em]shine [Bm]Thou
[C]On the [Am]Book [Bm]we [D]read;
[Bm]Gild [G/B]it's [Am]holy [C/E]pages
[G/D]With [D]the [G/D]light [D7]we [G]need.
